## Original Content
Выданы ордера на арест редактора газеты Denge, руководителя его офиса и автора материала

## Summary
Turkish prosecutors launched an investigation after a false report claiming President Erdogan died. Arrest warrants were issued for the editor of Denge newspaper, the head of its office, and the author of the material.

## Key Points
- A false report claiming Erdogan's death triggered a prosecutor's investigation in Turkey
- Arrest warrants were issued for three individuals connected to the false report
- The suspects include the editor of Denge newspaper, its office head, and the article's author


